From 5f49d596461ba1a1ca9638b5fa6c1d12028fe3b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Volodymyr Zolotopupov <zvova7890@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2026 03:32:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] primitives: Snap icon vertices to device pixels after final
 transform

Snap icon quad vertices in the shader after the final Qt Quick transform so they land on integer device pixels.
Fixes subpixel blur and keeps icons sharp at fractional DPR.

Origin: upstream, https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/kirigami/-/merge_requests/2070
Forwarded: not-needed, upstream backport for Frameworks/6.24
Last-Update: 2026-11-02
